2026-10-12 - Replaced profile photo

What changed
- resume/id.jpg replaced with a new photo (Sydney Harbour, Opera House in background).
- Source image was 2558x3198 portrait. Cropped to a square around head and shoulders
  (crop box x=40..1340, y=1380..2680 in source pixels) and resized to 600x600, JPEG quality 90.
- File size went from ~715 KB (2668x3335) to ~57 KB.

Why this size
- The photo box in material-dark (#myselfpic / .heading in src/resumes/material-dark.vue)
  is ~278x277 px with background-size: cover; background-position: center.
- A square crop means cover does not cut anything off, and 600x600 is ~2x the box size,
  so it stays sharp on retina screens and in the PDF export.

Scope
- No code changes. All 16 templates that reference resume/id.jpg now use the new photo.
- Old photo backed up outside the repo (session scratchpad, id.old.jpg); it is also still
  in git history.

Verification
- Dev server rebuilt automatically; checked http://localhost:8080/#/resume/material-dark
  in the browser and the new photo renders correctly in the header box.

